        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Frears, Jan Švankmajer, Gordon Warnecke, Hanif Kureishi, Daniel Day-Lewis\n- Works: My Beautiful Laundrette\n- Roles: Film director, filmmaker, artist, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Jan Švankmajer was born on 4 September 1934 and is a Czech filmmaker and artist whose work spans several media.\n- Stephen Frears was born on 20 June 1941 and is an English film director.\n- My Beautiful Laundrette is a 1985 British comedy-drama film directed by Stephen Frears from a screenplay by Hanif Kureishi.\n- Gordon Warnecke is known for playing Omar in the 1985 film My Beautiful Laundrette.\n- In My Beautiful Laundrette, Omar is the lover of Johnny, a character played by Daniel Day-Lewis.",
